    "text": "carrier_name (query11111.sql:23) has four value sources:\n- lgx.carrier.carrier_name: identity, the copied name.\n- lgx.carrier.carrier_code: conditional.\n- lgx.shipment_header.carrier_code: conditional.\n- lgx.shipment_header.shipment_id: conditional.\n\nThe three conditional sources are what choose the carrier. The graph doesn't give the exact condition.\n\nThe graph also shows filters on the whole result (pre-aggregation). They decide which rows appear, not the carrier itself:\n- shipment_header: is_deleted, shipment_id, status_code, updated_at.\n- shipment_line: line_status, promise_date, shipped_qty, unit_selling_price.\n\nNo boundaries or refusals on this lineage.",
